  "description": "Fair Deal Property, Your Trusted Experts for Residential Property Sales\n\nAre delighted to present to the market No. 20 Nuns' Island, a wonderfully located two-bedroom terraced home situated in the very heart of Galway City.\n\nOriginally constructed in 1920, this charming property enjoys a prime position in the heart of Galway's historic and cultural quarter.\n\nFrom here, residents can enjoy everything this wonderful city has to offer, with Galway University, the Latin Quarter and an outstanding selection of award-winning bars, restaurants, cafés and cultural attractions all within a short stroll. \n\nThe property extends to approximately 59 sq. m. of well laid out living space. \n\nOn arrival an entrance porch leads into a welcoming lounge, which offers ample seating space and features a charming fireplace, creating a warm and inviting focal point.\n\nThe lounge leads through to a particularly impressive, light-filled kitchen/diner situated within the rear extension. This wonderful space benefits from excellent natural light, with a  rear window and skylight combining to create a bright and airy kitchen and dining environment.\n\nExternally, the property enjoys a private courtyard area, providing valuable outdoor space together with additional storage. The courtyard also benefits from views towards the river beyond, adding an attractive feature to this central city home.\n\nUpstairs, the master bedroom is deceptively spacious, featuring double front-facing windows and ample space for wardrobes and additional furniture. A well-proportioned single bedroom and family bathroom complete the first-floor accommodation.\n\nNo. 20 Nuns' Island represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a charming two-bedroom city-centre home in one of Galway's most sought-after and convenient locations. Whether you are seeking a permanent city residence, a well-located investment property or a home that places you right at the centre of Galway's vibrant lifestyle, this property is certain to appeal.\n\nIf this sounds like the property for you, we would be delighted to hear from you and assist you in any way we can.\n\nBrought to you by Fair Deal Property, Your Trusted Experts for Residential Property Sales.",
